      en: ["The Holterberg reaches a maximum height of 59.5 meters.", "The Canadian War Cemetery contains 1,394 graves of fallen soldiers.", "It is the only area in the Netherlands with a wild Black Grouse population.", "Sallandse Heuvelrug National Park was officially proclaimed in 2004.", "The Holterberg Nature Museum was opened as early as 1938.", "The ridge was formed during the Saale glaciation due to massive ice pressure."],
