      en: ["Sint Jansberg is part of a terminal moraine formed during the Saale glaciation.", "Remains of a large Roman villa from the 2nd century AD were discovered here.", "The area contains several spring-fed streams and a historic watermill.", "The highest point of the reserve is approximately 75 meters above sea level.", "Sweet chestnut trees are a signature feature, some dating back centuries.", "It is a key location on the Pieterpad, the longest hiking trail in the Netherlands."],
      es: ["Altura: 72 m sobre el nivel del mar", "Geología: loess", "Nombrado en honor a: San Juan", "Capilla construida: siglo XVIII", "Superficie de viticultura: 5 ha", "Número de rutas de senderismo: 4"],
      pt: ["Altitude: 72 m acima do nível do mar", "Geologia: loess", "Nomeado em honra de: São João", "Capela construída: século XVIII", "Área de viticultura: 5 ha", "Número de trilhos: 4"],
      fr: ["Altitude : 72 m au-dessus du niveau de la mer", "Géologie : loess", "Nommé d'après : Saint Jean", "Chapelle construite : XVIIIe siècle", "Surface viticole : 5 ha", "Nombre de sentiers de randonnée : 4"],
