      en: ["The Holterberg is approximately 59 meters high, located in Overijssel.", "The hill hosts a Canadian War Cemetery with 1,394 individual graves.", "The terrain was formed by glacial activity around 150,000 years ago.", "The area is home to the last remaining black grouse population in the Netherlands.", "The Natuurdiorama Holterberg displays over 500 European animal species.", "The summit provides panoramic views across the Sallandse Heuvelrug park."],
