      en: ["The hill is part of a moraine ridge formed approximately 150,000 years ago.", "The Renkums Beekdal covers an area of about 300 hectares.", "The elevation difference between the hill crest and the valley floor is up to 30 meters.", "In the 19th century, there were nine active watermills in the Beekdal.", "The area underwent comprehensive ecological restoration starting in 2010.", "The subsoil consists of a mixture of cover layers and glacial deposits."],
